-- No condition reads `d` or `y`, and DATE_FROM_DMY raises at a day or a year
-- that is not a date, so the witnesses of the THEN arm can raise. The report
-- must name the error and the input it raised at (smucclaw/l4-ide#1096).
IMPORT prelude

GIVEN d IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `days since 1 March` d m y IS
    IF m AT LEAST 3
    THEN DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY d m y) MINUS DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 y)
    ELSE 0
